@startuml takeover
skinparam BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #0D47A1
    LifeLineBorderColor #1565C0
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #E3F2FD
    ParticipantBorderColor #1565C0
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #E3F2FD
    ParticipantFontColor #000000
    DatabaseBorderColor #1565C0
    DatabaseBackgroundColor #E3F2FD
    DatabaseFontColor #000000
}
skinparam note {
    BackgroundColor #FFF9C4
    BorderColor #FBC02D
    FontColor #000000
}

title Graceful and Force Takeover Sequence

participant "Destination Host\n(New Owner)" as Dest
participant "Destination Broker\n& Provider Auth" as Broker
participant "Mesh Network\n(Tailscale/SSH)" as Mesh
participant "Source Host\n(Old Owner)" as Src
database "Immutable\nRecords & Blobs" as Store

== Graceful Takeover ==
Dest -> Broker: Prove broker + provider-auth readiness
Broker --> Dest: tmux generation / provider build / macOS bound evidence
Dest -> Src: Request graceful takeover
Src -> Src: Wait for provider safe-turn boundary
Src -> Src: Quiesce input
Src -> Store: Fresh checkpoint
Src -> Store: Final bulk workspace/provider/task-board sync
Dest -> Store: Destination stage & validation
Src -> Src: Gracefully stop old owner
Src -> Store: Closure-delta sync (optional)
Dest -> Store: materialize.prepare / commit
Dest -> Store: Advance lease epoch (acquire exactly one destination lease)
Dest -> Store: Winning-lease verification
Dest -> Broker: Revalidate realm/auth after ownership commit
Dest -> Dest: Create destination runtime / finalize
Dest -> Store: Source replica and event publication
note right of Src: Old host becomes a replica

== Force Takeover (Recovery) ==
Dest -> Broker: Prove destination realm/auth readiness
Dest -> Store: Inert stage & validation
Dest -> Store: Capability / auth / profile checks
Dest -> Dest: Explicit split-brain confirmation
note over Dest,Src: Source stop is not claimed; old process may still exist.
Dest -> Store: Commit force lease / recompute winner
Store --> Dest: Winning lease authorizes activation
Dest -> Store: materialize.prepare / commit
note left of Dest: Warn split-brain risk.\nPreserve divergent history\nfor reconciliation.
Dest -> Dest: Create exact runtime / finalize
Dest -> Store: Fencing / preservation
Src -> Store: Attempt sync/resume
Store -->> Src: Fenced! (Stale lease)
note right of Src: Fenced from syncing/resuming

== Fork (Independent) ==
Dest -> Store: Clone from checkpoint
Dest -> Store: Create new logical session\nand workspace identity
Dest -> Dest: Independent ownership and history
note left of Dest: No change to original ownership
@enduml
